{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"这个人在幸福中开始感到疼，正在犹豫要不要少表达一点心意，以免自己受到更多伤害。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、隐痛、犹豫、担心\",\n      \"missed\": \"具体发生了什么需要读正文才能知道：刚握到手里却发现留不住，刚坚定地说了「是」又马上追问「可是呢」。幸福中逐渐掺入悲伤的变化也不容易一眼抓到。右侧其他七条情绪线索需要逐条读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"这个人原本相信幸福，却开始意识到幸福里也有疼痛，因此想收敛一点自己的心意。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、疼痛、不安、犹豫\",\n      \"missed\": \"正文中关于握住却留不住、坚定之后又怀疑的具体心理过程不容易扫到。右侧从不敢表达、害怕被嫌弃，到相信彼此需要、不再隐藏喜欢的变化过程，也需要逐条阅读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"这个人正在经历幸福与悲伤交织的状态，开始思考少袒露心意是否就能少受一点伤。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、隐隐作痛、矛盾、患得患失\",\n      \"missed\": \"具体的心理转折和幸福中逐渐出现悲伤的原因仍然藏在两行正文里。右侧八条短语之间的先后关系和变化过程，一眼无法完整串起来。下方金色曲线虽然有明显变化，但看不出它与人物处境的具体联系。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主标题和最后高亮的「幸福里也生出疼」形成了清楚的主题呼应，核心意思能抓到。最影响扫读的是右侧八条短语数量偏多、字号偏小，彼此之间的情绪变化关系不够直观；真正解释人物为什么会疼的正文又相对较长，需要阅读才能补齐。下半屏占据很大面积的金色点线动画有视觉存在感，却没有明确承接上半屏的人物情绪，因此整体是文字内部基本串得起来，但画面与人物处境之间的联系偏弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b3d2910b-7390-4b60-af21-3008f6f3f0d0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T005527606835Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:56:18.842550+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a32e3d2ddab82c3a9cf7fd8e93fff26956ea80c84dcc41f79c0a07a1d3eb4c9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T005527606835Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ef3013641646b52c2d597d9085927d2c4b2ea0dcbd7860e3d3a90da9f7068869"}}}
